-- Anki-IPS-4172
UPDATE questions SET explanation = '<div class=\"explanation-rich-content\"><div class=\"expl-card concept-card\"><div class=\"section-title-concept\">📌 Core Concept: Syslog Message Format</div><p>A Syslog message has the format seq:timestamp: %facility-severity-mnemonic:description. Each field tells you something different about the event.</p></div><div class=\"expl-card correct-card\"><h4 class=\"section-title-correct\">✓ Why the Correct Answer (Option C) is Correct:</h4><ul><li><span class=\"opt-tag correct\">Option C</span> <strong>description</strong>: The field is description: detailed information about the event being reported.</li></ul></div><div class=\"expl-card incorrect-card\"><h4 class=\"section-title-incorrect\">✗ Why Other Options are Incorrect:</h4><ul><li><span class=\"opt-tag wrong\">Option A</span> <strong>seq</strong>: seq is a different field: a number that indicates the order of messages.</li><li><span class=\"opt-tag wrong\">Option B</span> <strong>facility</strong>: facility is a different field: indicates which process on the device generated the message.</li><li><span class=\"opt-tag wrong\">Option D</span> <strong>timestamp</strong>: timestamp is a different field: indicates the time the message was generated.</li></ul></div><div class=\"expl-card tip-card\"><h4 class=\"section-title-tip\">💡 CCNA Exam Tip:</h4><p>Learn the format in order:</p><ul><li>seq.</li><li>timestamp.</li><li>facility.</li><li>severity.</li><li>mnemonic.</li><li>description.</li></ul></div><div class=\"expl-card concept-card\"><div class=\"section-title-concept\">📌 Source: Anki Flashcards - IP Services (CCNA / Day 41 Flashcards - Syslog)</div></div></div>' WHERE question_no = 'Anki-IPS-4172';

-- Anki-IPS-4173
UPDATE questions SET explanation = '<div class=\"explanation-rich-content\"><div class=\"expl-card concept-card\"><div class=\"section-title-concept\">📌 Core Concept: Syslog Message Fields</div><p>Every Syslog message is made of fields: seq, timestamp, facility, severity, mnemonic, and description. Each one answers a different question about the event.</p></div><div class=\"expl-card correct-card\"><h4 class=\"section-title-correct\">✓ Why the Correct Answer (Option B) is Correct:</h4><ul><li><span class=\"opt-tag correct\">Option B</span> <strong>seq</strong>: The field described is the sequence number, which shows the order in which messages were generated.</li></ul></div><div class=\"expl-card incorrect-card\"><h4 class=\"section-title-incorrect\">✗ Why Other Options are Incorrect:</h4><ul><li><span class=\"opt-tag wrong\">Option A</span> <strong>severity</strong>: severity is a different field: indicates how serious the logged event is.</li><li><span class=\"opt-tag wrong\">Option C</span> <strong>timestamp</strong>: timestamp is a different field: indicates the time the message was generated.</li><li><span class=\"opt-tag wrong\">Option D</span> <strong>facility</strong>: facility is a different field: indicates which process on the device generated the message.</li></ul></div><div class=\"expl-card tip-card\"><h4 class=\"section-title-tip\">💡 CCNA Exam Tip:</h4><p>Learn what each field means, not just its name:</p><ul><li>seq = order.</li><li>facility = which process.</li><li>severity = how serious.</li><li>mnemonic = what happened.</li></ul></div><div class=\"expl-card concept-card\"><div class=\"section-title-concept\">📌 Source: Anki Flashcards - IP Services (CCNA / Day 41 Flashcards - Syslog)</div></div></div>' WHERE question_no = 'Anki-IPS-4173';

